# Requests to try with VS Code's REST Client extension.
# Start the server first (npm start), then click Send Request above any request.

### Every plot: 200
GET http://localhost:3100/plots

### Only the free plots (2, 5 and 8): 200
GET http://localhost:3100/plots?free=true

### free=false is not "true", so every plot: 200
GET http://localhost:3100/plots?free=false

### One plot by its number: 200
GET http://localhost:3100/plots/7

### A plot that doesn't exist: 404
GET http://localhost:3100/plots/99

### Not a number at all: 404
GET http://localhost:3100/plots/seven

### An address the server doesn't know: 404
GET http://localhost:3100/compost
